  "root_contracts": [
    "Unread UI uses the actual Book.unread source consistent with actual SQL/controller sorting/filtering/read changes; do not fabricate counts or infer production behavior from a demo fixture.",
    "Selected source and shortcuts must visibly identify the actual same-name/correct-namespace source, including distinguishing00/01 and hidden More selection; preserve input and truthful current query state.",
